ugher-laws-on-street-homelessness/","line":31}],"metadata":{"title":"2 years after Grants Pass, 14 states, 350 cities have tougher laws on street homelessness • Idaho Capital Sun","source":"https://idahocapitalsun.com/2026/06/29/repub/2-years-after-grants-pass-14-states-350-cities-have-tougher-laws-on-street-homelessness/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=medical-marijuana-initiative-hits-snag-ranchers-cheer-grazing-changes-column-building-community-in-pocatello&_bhlid=facbed1430de9f84d621c1b6c3124586866f6052","author":null,"published":"2026-06-29","created":"2026-07-07","description":"Two years after the U.S. Supreme Court’s Grants Pass v. Johnson decision, more than 350 cities and 14 states have adopted laws or measures to crack down on street homelessness."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},